# astrion-skill v1
goal: Close all running apps with confirmation
trigger:
  - phrase: "close everything"
  - phrase: "quit all apps"
  - phrase: "close all"
do: |
  Query processManager.listRunning() for all running apps. Show a
  rapid-confirm modal listing the apps + a count: "Quit all N apps?
  Unsaved work will be lost." On confirm, call .quit() on each. Skip
  apps that have unsaved indicators (return their list at the end so
  the user knows what stayed open).
constraints:
  level: L3
  budget_tokens: 400
  reversibility: BOUNDED
